    "content": "<p>My mastodon instance of 1 user is getting hammered to its limits by AI scrapers.</p><p>Gigabytes of cached data and bandwidth for absolutely nothing.</p><p>Low disk space. Energy spikes. Memory spikes. CPU spikes. Human labor...</p><p>The cost is truly staggering, and this is for a single instance belonging to a single, otherwise insignificant individual. </p><p>Imagine the scale of resource abuse, theft, and climate destruction across the internet.</p><p>Just so people can use a shitty <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/AI\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>AI</span></a> prompt on their shitty site.</p>",
    "reblog": null,
    "account": {
      "id": "114040115938518155",
      "username": "jpoesen",
      "acct": "jpoesen@social.jpoesen.com",
      "display_name": "jpoesen | 🇪🇺 | 🏳️‍🌈",
      "locked": false,
      "bot": false,
