      "indexable": true,
      "group": false,
      "created_at": "2025-02-20T00:00:00.000Z",
      "note": "<p>Overambitious underachiever.</p><p>Currently building an <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/opensource\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>opensource</span></a>, human-sized, AI-free <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/CMS\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>CMS</span></a> (#PHP + <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/SQLite\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>SQLite</span></a>).</p><p>I live in the Spanish countryside where we're slowly fixing an old <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/farm\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>farm</span></a> house &amp; try to live a low-footprint, <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/eco\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>eco</span></a> friendly life. </p><p>I maintain educational websites and will teach you <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/HTML\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>HTML</span></a>, <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/PHP\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>PHP</span></a>, <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/SQL\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>SQL</span></a>, or <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/Linux\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Linux</span></a> things if you're not careful.</p><p><a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/Knowledge\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Knowledge</span></a> is power.<br><a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/Education\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Education</span></a> is everything.</p><p><a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/MoveSlowAndMendThings\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>MoveSlowAndMendThings</span></a> <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/LoveIsLove\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>LoveIsLove</span></a>. <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/ResistAI\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>ResistAI</span></a>. <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/FreePalestine\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>FreePalestine</span></a>. <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/SlavaUkraini\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>SlavaUkraini</span></a>. <a href=\"https://social.jpoesen.com/tags/NoPasar%C3%A1n\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>NoPasarán</span></a>.</p>",
